# Host artefacts must never leak into an image: node_modules in particular contains
# platform-specific binaries that would break the build inside the container.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/venv
**/*.egg-info

.git
.github
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.log

docs
exports
